        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Psi. Usando seus poderes psíquicos, Kadabra levita enquanto dorme e utiliza sua cauda flexível como travesseiro. Sua telecinese é extremamente poderosa. Para se preparar para evoluir, ele acumula energia psíquica na estrela de sua testa.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 6 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Kadabra pode evoluir para Alakazam no nível 12 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion, Kinesis, Teleport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Miracle Eye</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Reflect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Psycho Cut, Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Recover, Telekinesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Ally Switch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Role Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Calm Mind, Future Sight, Trick</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dream Eater, Embargo, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gravity, Guard Swap, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psycho Cut, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Speed Swap, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Thief, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Tri Attack, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt Def esa s d e T ipo : ½ ½ x2 x2 x2</p>",
